      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would love to also see this also have permissions for certain group roles to have moderation permission in group worlds. Would help a lot in public RP worlds, event worlds, and even just regular sessions where the uploader of the world can't be online all the time to kick or moderate people. I've seen multiple times where a session is ruined due to not having the creator of the world on and vote to kick not working on the person.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
